OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and scattered
OL,6,Fshowers today across Scotland, and
OL,7,Ffeeling cool here. Cloudy across
OL,8,Fnorthern England Wales and the
OL,9,FMidlands with showery outbreaks of
OL,10,Frain. Warm sunny spells in the
OL,11,Fsoutheast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain gradually spreading
OL,14,Facross England and Wales tonight,
OL,15,Fturning heavy at times. Chilly in
OL,16,FScotland and Northern Ireland with a
OL,17,Fpatchy frost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
